# -------- NOTE ABOUT public/uploads --------
# Ignored, because scripts/seedData.js writes placeholder images into
# it every time it runs. Nothing in there needs to travel through git.
#
# Anything you upload yourself through the Edit form also lands here
# and is NOT committed - so a product you add on your machine will show
# a broken image on someone else's until they upload their own.
# That is the usual trade-off: on a real project uploads go to cloud
# storage, not into the repo.
public/uploads/